# What gets uploaded to Vercel. The first line ignores everything at the top level; each "!"
# line lets one thing back in. So only the website goes up, and the original logo, the
# president's doc, the tools and the planning notes (which hold unconfirmed facts) stay off the site.
/*
!/index.html
!/404.html
!/about
!/styles.css
!/app.js
!/content.js
!/content.json
!/images
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/vercel.json
